+ (N0FE7,N0FDD,N0FO5)))}
.FUNC N0FXE(N0FE7,N0FDD,N0FO5)={N0FX6(N0FE7,N0FDD,N0FO5)+N0FMY(0.25*(N0FDD-VBR))}
.FUNC N0FYL(N0FE7,N0FDD)={N0FDD/(N0FW2(N0FE7))}
